      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Otorrhea is an ambiguous symptom that underlies diverse clinical pictures. Fundamentally, the treatment of uncomplicated acute otitis externa and media can be carried out by the family physician. An ENT specialist should be definitely consulted in cases of complications or development of a chronic condition."},
